<div x-data="{}">
  <button
    type="button"
    @click="$refs.compressDialog.showModal()"
    aria-haspopup="dialog"
    aria-controls="audio-compress-dialog-<%= fileId %>"
    class="inline-flex h-8 items-center gap-1 rounded-full border-0 bg-stone-100 px-3 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-700 ring-0 transition hover:bg-stone-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-500">
    <span
      class="i-lucide-archive h-3.5 w-3.5"
      aria-hidden="true"></span>
    오디오 압축
  </button>
  <dialog
    id="audio-compress-dialog-<%= fileId %>"
    x-ref="compressDialog"
    aria-labelledby="audio-compress-title-<%= fileId %>"
    @click="if ($event.target === $el) $el.close()"
    class="fixed inset-0 m-auto max-h-[88dvh] w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-md overflow-y-auto rounded-[1.75rem] border-none bg-[#fbf7ef] p-0 text-left text-stone-950 shadow-xl backdrop:bg-black/40">
    <form
      method="post"
      action="<%= action %>"
      class="m-0 space-y-5 p-6"
      @click.stop>
      <% for (const name of Object.keys(fields)) { %>
      <input
        type="hidden"
        name="<%= name %>"
        value="<%= fields[name] %>" />
      <% } %>
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <h3
            id="audio-compress-title-<%= fileId %>"
            class="m-0 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
            오디오 압축
          </h3>
          <p class="m-0 mt-1 truncate text-sm text-stone-500"><%= bookTitle %></p>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          @click="$refs.compressDialog.close()"
          aria-label="닫기"
          class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full border-none bg-stone-200/60 text-stone-700">
          <span
            class="i-lucide-x h-4 w-4"
            aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <label class="block space-y-1.5">
        <span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-stone-800">비트레이트</span>
        <select
          name="kbps"
          required
          class="box-border h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-solid border-stone-300 bg-white px-3 text-sm text-stone-900 focus-visible:outline-stone-500">
          <% for (const kbps of bitrates) { %>
          <option
            value="<%= kbps %>"
            <%= kbps === (currentKbps || 64) ? 'selected' : '' %>>
            <%= kbps %>kbps (원본 128kbps의 <%= Math.round((kbps / 128) * 100) %>%)
          </option>
          <% } %>
        </select>
      </label>

      <ul class="m-0 list-none space-y-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/70 p-3 text-xs leading-5 text-stone-600">
        <li>완성된 구간부터 5분마다 몇 개씩 줄이고, 앞으로 완성되는 구간도 같은 값으로 줄입니다.</li>
        <li>낭독은 64kbps 모노가 보편적이고, 48kbps는 높은 소리가 조금 거칠어질 수 있습니다.</li>
        <li class="font-semibold text-[#8e5521]">
          원본은 남지 않아 되돌릴 수 없습니다. 다시 높이려면 재생성해야 합니다.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="space-y-2.5 pt-1">
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="inline-flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full border-none bg-stone-900 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white ring-0 transition outline-none hover:bg-stone-700">
          압축 요청
        </button>
        <% if (currentKbps) { %>
        <p class="m-0 text-center text-xs leading-5 text-stone-400">지금 요청된 값: <%= currentKbps %>kbps</p>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
</div>
